module provenance_lineage_lsp_projection

input lineage_status
input missing_stage
input edge_count
input chain_digest
input evidence_digest
input read_only
input non_authorizing

status BOUND validated provenance lineage is exposed read-only
status UNKNOWN lineage evidence is incomplete, invalid, or crosses a capability boundary

field publishable
field severity
field code
field observation_digest

constraint read_only
constraint no_improvement_claim
constraint no_execution
constraint no_authorization
constraint no_edits
constraint no_command